{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":41,"creatorName":"Mira Murati","creatorHandle":"miramurati","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":988543,"authorHandle":"miramurati","authorUserId":"180115578","authorName":"Mira Murati","authorFollowersObserved":992059,"authorFollowingObserved":641,"authorPostsObserved":402,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_originals_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:27:09.373Z","id":"2083339072987431011","postType":"quote","text":"We share our approach to open-weights releases, how we assessed Inkling, why safety depends on both the model and the ecosystem it enters, and how testing, staged access, and stronger defenses can create a path toward greater openness.","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":235,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1785541716000,"postedAt":"2026-07-31T23:48:36.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":813.6426036111111,"url":"https://x.com/miramurati/status/2083339072987431011","views":200514,"likes":1623,"reposts":119,"replies":65,"bookmarks":237,"quotes":10,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":"2083338736436400536","quotedPost":{"id":"2083338736436400536","authorHandle":"thinkymachines","authorName":"Thinking Machines","authorFollowersObserved":182295,"text":"Releasing weights indiscriminately isn't safe. Neither is keeping capable models inside a few labs.\n\nWe think there's a path between them. We haven't mapped all of it. Our new post covers the part we can see: how we assessed Inkling, and why access should widen in stages.\n\nhttps://t.co/zGFbuXNr0Y","textSource":"note_tweet","postedAt":"2026-07-31T23:47:15.000Z","views":536157,"likes":1330,"reposts":149,"replies":68,"bookmarks":736,"quotes":51,"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0},"inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToUsername":null,"conversationId":"2083339072987431011","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":1}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":41,"creatorName":"Mira Murati","creatorHandle":"miramurati","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":988543,"authorHandle":"miramurati","authorUserId":"180115578","authorName":"Mira Murati","authorFollowersObserved":992059,"authorFollowingObserved":641,"authorPostsObserved":402,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_originals_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:27:09.373Z","id":"2082886925988598138","postType":"quote","text":"Inkling-Small is comparable to Inkling at a quarter the size. Weights are open, fine-tunable on Tinker today. Look forward to seeing what people make with it.","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":158,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1785433915000,"postedAt":"2026-07-30T17:51:55.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":843.5873258333334,"url":"https://x.com/miramurati/status/2082886925988598138","views":461344,"likes":3719,"reposts":283,"replies":148,"bookmarks":557,"quotes":36,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":"2082885869426631032","quotedPost":{"id":"2082885869426631032","authorHandle":"thinkymachines","authorName":"Thinking Machines","authorFollowersObserved":182295,"text":"Today, we are releasing Inkling-Small.\n\nInkling-Small achieves comparable performance to Inkling at a quarter of its size. It features 276B total parameters, 12B active. We are making the full weights available.\n\nhttps://t.co/BtYNcpkDRA\n\nFine-tune it on Tinker today, or chat with it in text, image, and audio on Tinker Playground.","textSource":"note_tweet","postedAt":"2026-07-30T17:47:44.000Z","views":1559288,"likes":3326,"reposts":451,"replies":161,"bookmarks":1095,"quotes":213,"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0},"inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToUsername":null,"conversationId":"2082886925988598138","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":2}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":41,"creatorName":"Mira Murati","creatorHandle":"miramurati","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":988543,"authorHandle":"miramurati","authorUserId":"180115578","authorName":"Mira Murati","authorFollowersObserved":992059,"authorFollowingObserved":641,"authorPostsObserved":402,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_originals_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:27:09.373Z","id":"2080715390179766646","postType":"quote","text":"The knowledge that makes AI useful is diffused. It lives with scientists, engineers, clinicians, firms. For AI to benefit from distributed knowledge, it must itself be distributed. Agree with Jensen that this is a future worth building.","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":236,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1784916181000,"postedAt":"2026-07-24T18:03:01.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":987.4023258333333,"url":"https://x.com/miramurati/status/2080715390179766646","views":1044120,"likes":8923,"reposts":1029,"replies":331,"bookmarks":895,"quotes":61,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":"2080643682408321103","quotedPost":{"id":"2080643682408321103","authorHandle":"JensenHuang","authorName":"Jensen Huang","authorFollowersObserved":1045608,"text":"For my first post, I’m sharing a letter @NVIDIA signed on why open models matter.\n\nAI will transform every industry, power every company, and be built by every country.\n\nOpen models strengthen safety and cybersecurity, accelerate innovation and diffusion, and enable sovereignty.\n\nThe world needs both frontier closed models and frontier open models.\n\nhttps://t.co/AUKzoQ5Ikb","textSource":"note_tweet","postedAt":"2026-07-24T13:18:05.000Z","views":66097315,"likes":172660,"reposts":29598,"replies":16141,"bookmarks":39377,"quotes":10945,"media":[{"id":"2080638895952420864","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HN_qDVsa4AAI6XJ.jpg","expandedUrl":"https://x.com/JensenHuang/status/2080643682408321103/photo/1","altText":null,"width":1224,"height":1584,"durationMs":null},{"id":"2080638895990173696","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HN_qDV1a8AARQwg.jpg","expandedUrl":"https://x.com/JensenHuang/status/2080643682408321103/photo/1","altText":null,"width":1224,"height":1584,"durationMs":null},{"id":"2080638895990161408","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HN_qDV1awAAPTlH.jpg","expandedUrl":"https://x.com/JensenHuang/status/2080643682408321103/photo/1","altText":null,"width":1224,"height":1584,"durationMs":null}],"photoCount":3,"videoCount":0},"inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToUsername":null,"conversationId":"2080715390179766646","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":3}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":41,"creatorName":"Mira Murati","creatorHandle":"miramurati","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":988543,"authorHandle":"miramurati","authorUserId":"180115578","authorName":"Mira Murati","authorFollowersObserved":992059,"authorFollowingObserved":641,"authorPostsObserved":402,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_originals_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:27:09.373Z","id":"2077455974743593100","postType":"quote","text":"Our first model, Inkling. Trained from scratch, weights are open, fine-tunable on Tinker today.","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":95,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1784139076000,"postedAt":"2026-07-15T18:11:16.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":1203.2648258333334,"url":"https://x.com/miramurati/status/2077455974743593100","views":1582917,"likes":13638,"reposts":1100,"replies":399,"bookmarks":2775,"quotes":173,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":"2077454609551921208","quotedPost":{"id":"2077454609551921208","authorHandle":"thinkymachines","authorName":"Thinking Machines","authorFollowersObserved":182295,"text":"Today, we are introducing Inkling.\n\nInkling reasons efficiently across text, image, and audio modalities. We are making the full weights available.\n\nhttps://t.co/Ghebq5mG30\n\nAvailable today for fine-tuning on Tinker. Play with it in the Inkling Playground. 🧵","textSource":"legacy_full_text","postedAt":"2026-07-15T18:05:50.000Z","views":8274537,"likes":14910,"reposts":2018,"replies":562,"bookmarks":7614,"quotes":1189,"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0},"inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToUsername":null,"conversationId":"2077455974743593100","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":4}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":41,"creatorName":"Mira Murati","creatorHandle":"miramurati","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":988543,"authorHandle":"miramurati","authorUserId":"180115578","authorName":"Mira Murati","authorFollowersObserved":992059,"authorFollowingObserved":641,"authorPostsObserved":402,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_originals_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:27:09.373Z","id":"2075621070133223455","postType":"quote","text":"A year ago we set out to empower humanity with a focus on multimodal AI, custom models, and open science.\n\nWe previewed interaction models that collaborate the way people do. Tinker lets anyone train their own open weights models. We published our research on Connectionism.","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":274,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1783701600000,"postedAt":"2026-07-10T16:40:00.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":1324.7859369444445,"url":"https://x.com/miramurati/status/2075621070133223455","views":406897,"likes":1799,"reposts":111,"replies":59,"bookmarks":494,"quotes":16,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":"1945166365834535247","quotedPost":{"id":"1945166365834535247","authorHandle":"miramurati","authorName":"Mira Murati","authorFollowersObserved":992059,"text":"Thinking Machines Lab exists to empower humanity through advancing collaborative general intelligence.\n\nWe're building multimodal AI that works with how you naturally interact with the world - through conversation, through sight, through the messy way we collaborate. We're excited that in the next couple months we’ll be able to share our first product, which will include a significant open source component and be useful for researchers and startups developing custom models. Soon, we’ll also share our best science to help the research community better understand frontier AI systems.\n\nTo accelerate our progress, we’re happy to confirm that we’ve raised $2B led by a16z with participation from NVIDIA, Accel, ServiceNow, CISCO, AMD, Jane Street and more who share our mission.\n\nWe’re always looking for extraordinary talent that learns by doing, turning research into useful things. We believe AI should serve as an extension of individual agency and, in the spirit of freedom, be distributed as widely and equitably as possible.  We hope this vision resonates with those who share our commitment to advancing the field. If so, join us. https://t.co/EaAKidpany","textSource":"note_tweet","postedAt":"2025-07-15T16:59:35.000Z","views":2688268,"likes":7693,"reposts":673,"replies":632,"bookmarks":1821,"quotes":257,"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0},"inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToUsername":null,"conversationId":"2075621070133223455","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":5}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":41,"creatorName":"Mira Murati","creatorHandle":"miramurati","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":988543,"authorHandle":"miramurati","authorUserId":"180115578","authorName":"Mira Murati","authorFollowersObserved":992059,"authorFollowingObserved":641,"authorPostsObserved":402,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_originals_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:27:09.373Z","id":"2072050039317578236","postType":"original","text":"Bridgewater used their unique financial knowledge and partnered with us on @tinkerapi to fine-tune a model that helps their analysts focus on what's important. Experts improving AI that empowers experts.\nhttps://t.co/6RJITMG2BJ","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":227,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1782850200000,"postedAt":"2026-06-30T20:10:00.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":1561.2859369444445,"url":"https://x.com/miramurati/status/2072050039317578236","views":1484011,"likes":3580,"reposts":319,"replies":91,"bookmarks":2955,"quotes":116,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":["tinkerapi"],"urls":["https://thinkingmachines.ai/news/learning-to-replicate-expert-judgment-in-financial-tasks/"],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":null,"quotedPost":null,"inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToUsername":null,"conversationId":"2072050039317578236","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":6}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":41,"creatorName":"Mira Murati","creatorHandle":"miramurati","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":988543,"authorHandle":"miramurati","authorUserId":"180115578","authorName":"Mira Murati","authorFollowersObserved":992059,"authorFollowingObserved":641,"authorPostsObserved":402,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_originals_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:27:09.373Z","id":"2056797399394422918","postType":"quote","text":"Collaborative AI runs on interactivity: machines and people, working in real time, across every modality. Solving it takes a community, join us.","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":144,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1779213688000,"postedAt":"2026-05-19T18:01:28.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":2571.428159166667,"url":"https://x.com/miramurati/status/2056797399394422918","views":285122,"likes":1621,"reposts":119,"replies":92,"bookmarks":437,"quotes":9,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":"2056786920836145410","quotedPost":{"id":"2056786920836145410","authorHandle":"thinkymachines","authorName":"Thinking Machines","authorFollowersObserved":182295,"text":"We are offering grants of $100,000 + Tinker credits to researchers advancing the field of human-AI interactivity. Submit your proposals by June 19th!\n\nhttps://t.co/907HfBy7g3","textSource":"legacy_full_text","postedAt":"2026-05-19T17:19:49.000Z","views":721874,"likes":1727,"reposts":203,"replies":61,"bookmarks":1561,"quotes":36,"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0},"inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToUsername":null,"conversationId":"2056797399394422918","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":7}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":41,"creatorName":"Mira Murati","creatorHandle":"miramurati","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":988543,"authorHandle":"miramurati","authorUserId":"180115578","authorName":"Mira Murati","authorFollowersObserved":992059,"authorFollowingObserved":641,"authorPostsObserved":402,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_originals_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:27:09.373Z","id":"2053939069890298321","postType":"original","text":"Today we're sharing our work on interaction models. A new class of model trained from scratch to handle real-time interaction natively, instead of gluing it onto a turn-based one.\nhttps://t.co/MoS5s4cm60","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":203,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1778532209000,"postedAt":"2026-05-11T20:43:29.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":2760.727881388889,"url":"https://x.com/miramurati/status/2053939069890298321","views":1256809,"likes":9048,"reposts":932,"replies":346,"bookmarks":3465,"quotes":200,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":["https://youtu.be/A12AVongNN4"],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":null,"quotedPost":null,"inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToUsername":null,"conversationId":"2053939069890298321","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":8}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":41,"creatorName":"Mira Murati","creatorHandle":"miramurati","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":988543,"authorHandle":"miramurati","authorUserId":"180115578","authorName":"Mira Murati","authorFollowersObserved":992059,"authorFollowingObserved":641,"authorPostsObserved":402,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_originals_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:27:09.373Z","id":"2043740848337367488","postType":"quote","text":"Welcome @luke_drago_ and @LRudL_ to @thinkymachines. They started Workshop Labs determined to build AI that keeps the future human. They’ll continue that mission at Thinking Machines, where we create powerful AI systems that think alongside humans and extend our agency. \n\nFrom Tinker to our research grants to the work we're doing to advance the frontier, everything we do is in service of the same mission -- AI that keeps our civilization empowered. Luke and Rudolf have been building toward the same thing.\n\nThere's a path for AI to make humans matter more. Glad to have them working on it with us.","textSource":"note_tweet","textLength":602,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1776100763000,"postedAt":"2026-04-13T17:19:23.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":3436.1295480555555,"url":"https://x.com/miramurati/status/2043740848337367488","views":117083,"likes":592,"reposts":34,"replies":34,"bookmarks":70,"quotes":8,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":["luke_drago_","LRudL_","thinkymachines"],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":"2043736757943054752","quotedPost":{"id":"2043736757943054752","authorHandle":"luke_drago_","authorName":"Luke Drago","authorFollowersObserved":4998,"text":"Cat’s out of the bag! Today @WorkshopLabs is joining @ThinkyMachines.\n\nWe started Workshop Labs to build towards a world where people still matter, even as powerful AI advances. I want to talk a bit about why this is the best move to serve that mission.","textSource":"legacy_full_text","postedAt":"2026-04-13T17:03:08.000Z","views":189424,"likes":538,"reposts":25,"replies":60,"bookmarks":109,"quotes":12,"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0},"inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToUsername":null,"conversationId":"2043740848337367488","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":9}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":41,"creatorName":"Mira Murati","creatorHandle":"miramurati","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":988543,"authorHandle":"miramurati","authorUserId":"180115578","authorName":"Mira Murati","authorFollowersObserved":992059,"authorFollowingObserved":641,"authorPostsObserved":402,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_originals_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:27:09.373Z","id":"2031355859071283377","postType":"original","text":"Grateful to Jensen and @nvidia team for their support. Together, we’re working to deploy at least 1GW of Vera Rubin systems, bringing adaptable collaborative AI to everyone.\nhttps://t.co/FiOL7SRbut https://t.co/WdUkeLl7sL","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":221,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1773147952000,"postedAt":"2026-03-10T13:05:52.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":4256.354825833333,"url":"https://x.com/miramurati/status/2031355859071283377","views":566614,"likes":3856,"reposts":274,"replies":165,"bookmarks":486,"quotes":50,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":["nvidia"],"urls":["https://thinkingmachines.ai/nvidia-partnership/"],"media":[{"id":"2031355561464549376","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HDDTHt2b0AALUZ_.jpg","expandedUrl":"https://x.com/miramurati/status/2031355859071283377/photo/1","altText":null,"width":4096,"height":3519,"durationMs":null}],"photoCount":1,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":null,"quotedPost":null,"inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToUsername":null,"conversationId":"2031355859071283377","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":10}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":41,"creatorName":"Mira Murati","creatorHandle":"miramurati","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":988543,"authorHandle":"miramurati","authorUserId":"180115578","authorName":"Mira Murati","authorFollowersObserved":992059,"authorFollowingObserved":641,"authorPostsObserved":402,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_originals_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:27:09.373Z","id":"2011577319295692801","postType":"original","text":"We have parted ways with Barret Zoph. \n\nSoumith Chintala will be the new CTO of Thinking Machines. He is a brilliant and seasoned leader who has made important contributions to the AI field for over a decade, and he’s been a major contributor to our team. We could not be more excited to have him take on this new responsibility.","textSource":"note_tweet","textLength":329,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1768432380000,"postedAt":"2026-01-14T23:13:00.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":5566.235936944445,"url":"https://x.com/miramurati/status/2011577319295692801","views":1002562,"likes":4164,"reposts":127,"replies":245,"bookmarks":641,"quotes":86,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":null,"quotedPost":null,"inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToUsername":null,"conversationId":"2011577319295692801","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":11}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":41,"creatorName":"Mira Murati","creatorHandle":"miramurati","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":988543,"authorHandle":"miramurati","authorUserId":"180115578","authorName":"Mira Murati","authorFollowersObserved":992059,"authorFollowingObserved":641,"authorPostsObserved":402,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_originals_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:27:09.373Z","id":"1999546821438234937","postType":"quote","text":"We're making Tinker generally available with new models and features.","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":69,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1765564086000,"postedAt":"2025-12-12T18:28:06.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":6362.984270277778,"url":"https://x.com/miramurati/status/1999546821438234937","views":549039,"likes":2814,"reposts":165,"replies":110,"bookmarks":522,"quotes":21,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":"1999543421631946888","quotedPost":{"id":"1999543421631946888","authorHandle":"thinkymachines","authorName":"Thinking Machines","authorFollowersObserved":182295,"text":"Tinker is now generally available. We also added support for advanced vision input models, Kimi K2 Thinking, and a simpler way to sample from models.\n\nhttps://t.co/nvaJHkGxc0","textSource":"legacy_full_text","postedAt":"2025-12-12T18:14:36.000Z","views":1150463,"likes":1664,"reposts":169,"replies":48,"bookmarks":665,"quotes":48,"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0},"inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToUsername":null,"conversationId":"1999546821438234937","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":12}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":41,"creatorName":"Mira Murati","creatorHandle":"miramurati","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":988543,"authorHandle":"miramurati","authorUserId":"180115578","authorName":"Mira Murati","authorFollowersObserved":992059,"authorFollowingObserved":641,"authorPostsObserved":402,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_originals_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:27:09.373Z","id":"1993801039804612991","postType":"quote","text":"Consider joining us https://t.co/WzNNHtd3Oa","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":43,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1764194185000,"postedAt":"2025-11-26T21:56:25.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":6743.512325833333,"url":"https://x.com/miramurati/status/1993801039804612991","views":587605,"likes":1584,"reposts":93,"replies":88,"bookmarks":630,"quotes":8,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":["https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/thinkingmachines"],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":"1993383480458461338","quotedPost":{"id":"1993383480458461338","authorHandle":"clarejtbirch","authorName":"clare ❤️‍🔥","authorFollowersObserved":6978,"text":"we are opening a bunch of new roles at @thinkymachines this week. research roles are live, more to come 👇","textSource":"legacy_full_text","postedAt":"2025-11-25T18:17:11.000Z","views":793145,"likes":821,"reposts":28,"replies":26,"bookmarks":521,"quotes":6,"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0},"inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToUsername":null,"conversationId":"1993801039804612991","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":13}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":41,"creatorName":"Mira Murati","creatorHandle":"miramurati","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":988543,"authorHandle":"miramurati","authorUserId":"180115578","authorName":"Mira Murati","authorFollowersObserved":992059,"authorFollowingObserved":641,"authorPostsObserved":402,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_originals_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:27:09.373Z","id":"1983584539210608900","postType":"quote","text":"As part of our commitment to open and collaborative science, we’re expanding free access to Tinker for researchers and instructors with our grants program.","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":155,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1761758382000,"postedAt":"2025-10-29T17:19:42.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":7420.124270277778,"url":"https://x.com/miramurati/status/1983584539210608900","views":296564,"likes":1855,"reposts":143,"replies":132,"bookmarks":348,"quotes":5,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":"1983584175845470521","quotedPost":{"id":"1983584175845470521","authorHandle":"thinkymachines","authorName":"Thinking Machines","authorFollowersObserved":182295,"text":"Today we’re announcing research and teaching grants for Tinker: credits for scholars and students to fine-tune and experiment with open-weight LLMs.\n\nRead more and apply at: https://t.co/EAx6uOpDCS","textSource":"legacy_full_text","postedAt":"2025-10-29T17:18:15.000Z","views":509261,"likes":997,"reposts":125,"replies":19,"bookmarks":593,"quotes":21,"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0},"inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToUsername":null,"conversationId":"1983584539210608900","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":14}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":41,"creatorName":"Mira Murati","creatorHandle":"miramurati","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":988543,"authorHandle":"miramurati","authorUserId":"180115578","authorName":"Mira Murati","authorFollowersObserved":992059,"authorFollowingObserved":641,"authorPostsObserved":402,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_originals_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:27:09.373Z","id":"1982856564970254772","postType":"quote","text":"Combining the benefits of RL and SFT with on-policy distillation, a promising approach for training small models for domain performance and continual learning.","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":159,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1761584819000,"postedAt":"2025-10-27T17:06:59.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":7468.336214722222,"url":"https://x.com/miramurati/status/1982856564970254772","views":486885,"likes":2805,"reposts":215,"replies":99,"bookmarks":1200,"quotes":32,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":"1982856272023302322","quotedPost":{"id":"1982856272023302322","authorHandle":"thinkymachines","authorName":"Thinking Machines","authorFollowersObserved":182295,"text":"Our latest post explores on-policy distillation, a training approach that unites the error-correcting relevance of RL with the reward density of SFT. When training it for math reasoning and as an internal chat assistant, we find that on-policy distillation can outperform other approaches for a fraction of the cost.\n\nhttps://t.co/JhpyWQOpBe","textSource":"note_tweet","postedAt":"2025-10-27T17:05:49.000Z","views":1947852,"likes":2776,"reposts":402,"replies":59,"bookmarks":1934,"quotes":154,"media":[{"id":"1982855816936919041","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G4SE3CFXkAEZaSf.png","expandedUrl":"https://x.com/thinkymachines/status/1982856272023302322/photo/1","altText":null,"width":720,"height":342,"durationMs":null}],"photoCount":1,"videoCount":0},"inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToUsername":null,"conversationId":"1982856564970254772","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":15}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":41,"creatorName":"Mira Murati","creatorHandle":"miramurati","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":988543,"authorHandle":"miramurati","authorUserId":"180115578","authorName":"Mira Murati","authorFollowersObserved":992059,"authorFollowingObserved":641,"authorPostsObserved":402,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_originals_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:27:09.373Z","id":"1973498366521954774","postType":"quote","text":"Today we launched Tinker.\n\nTinker brings frontier tools to researchers, offering clean abstractions for writing experiments and training pipelines while handling distributed training complexity. It enables novel research, custom models, and solid baselines.\n\nExcited to see what people build.","textSource":"note_tweet","textLength":292,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1759353651000,"postedAt":"2025-10-01T21:20:51.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":8088.105103611111,"url":"https://x.com/miramurati/status/1973498366521954774","views":636495,"likes":5382,"reposts":501,"replies":182,"bookmarks":1501,"quotes":51,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":"1973447428977336578","quotedPost":{"id":"1973447428977336578","authorHandle":"thinkymachines","authorName":"Thinking Machines","authorFollowersObserved":182295,"text":"Introducing Tinker: a flexible API for fine-tuning language models.\n\nWrite training loops in Python on your laptop; we'll run them on distributed GPUs.\n\nPrivate beta starts today. We can't wait to see what researchers and developers build with cutting-edge open models!\n\nhttps://t.co/tJsgxgBuWo","textSource":"note_tweet","postedAt":"2025-10-01T17:58:26.000Z","views":4205437,"likes":5831,"reposts":782,"replies":240,"bookmarks":3131,"quotes":375,"media":[{"id":"1973447373239230471","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G2MX7iDaIAclPKq.png","expandedUrl":"https://x.com/thinkymachines/status/1973447428977336578/photo/1","altText":null,"width":720,"height":378,"durationMs":null}],"photoCount":1,"videoCount":0},"inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToUsername":null,"conversationId":"1973498366521954774","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":16}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":41,"creatorName":"Mira Murati","creatorHandle":"miramurati","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":988543,"authorHandle":"miramurati","authorUserId":"180115578","authorName":"Mira Murati","authorFollowersObserved":992059,"authorFollowingObserved":641,"authorPostsObserved":402,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_originals_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:27:09.373Z","id":"1972725548494577735","postType":"quote","text":"Today on Connectionism: establishing the conditions under which LoRA matches full fine-tuning performance, with new experimental results and a grounding in information theory","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":174,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1759169396000,"postedAt":"2025-09-29T18:09:56.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":8139.287048055556,"url":"https://x.com/miramurati/status/1972725548494577735","views":205624,"likes":1726,"reposts":126,"replies":53,"bookmarks":428,"quotes":12,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":"1972708674100765006","quotedPost":{"id":"1972708674100765006","authorHandle":"thinkymachines","authorName":"Thinking Machines","authorFollowersObserved":182295,"text":"LoRA makes fine-tuning more accessible, but it's unclear how it compares to full fine-tuning. We find that the performance often matches closely---more often than you might expect. In our latest Connectionism post, we share our experimental results and recommendations for LoRA.\n\nhttps://t.co/fYV4FPi71m","textSource":"note_tweet","postedAt":"2025-09-29T17:02:53.000Z","views":1456756,"likes":3472,"reposts":553,"replies":82,"bookmarks":2357,"quotes":177,"media":[{"id":"1972708439957942273","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G2B339EbsAE2N7b.png","expandedUrl":"https://x.com/thinkymachines/status/1972708674100765006/photo/1","altText":null,"width":1604,"height":843,"durationMs":null}],"photoCount":1,"videoCount":0},"inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToUsername":null,"conversationId":"1972725548494577735","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":17}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":41,"creatorName":"Mira Murati","creatorHandle":"miramurati","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":988543,"authorHandle":"miramurati","authorUserId":"180115578","authorName":"Mira Murati","authorFollowersObserved":992059,"authorFollowingObserved":641,"authorPostsObserved":402,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_originals_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:27:09.373Z","id":"1971624309262373359","postType":"quote","text":"Sharing our second Connectionism research post on Modular Manifolds, a mathematical approach to refining training at each layer of the neural network","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":149,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1758906840000,"postedAt":"2025-09-26T17:14:00.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":8212.219270277777,"url":"https://x.com/miramurati/status/1971624309262373359","views":289194,"likes":2514,"reposts":245,"replies":84,"bookmarks":678,"quotes":21,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":"1971623409873244462","quotedPost":{"id":"1971623409873244462","authorHandle":"thinkymachines","authorName":"Thinking Machines","authorFollowersObserved":182295,"text":"Efficient training of neural networks is difficult. Our second Connectionism post introduces Modular Manifolds, a theoretical step toward more stable and performant training by co-designing neural net optimizers with manifold constraints on weight matrices. \n\nhttps://t.co/PGG4zy3u23\n\nWe explore a fundamental understanding of the geometry of neural network optimization.","textSource":"note_tweet","postedAt":"2025-09-26T17:10:26.000Z","views":1541107,"likes":2889,"reposts":427,"replies":110,"bookmarks":1793,"quotes":142,"media":[{"id":"1971621801223479296","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G1yblQVXYAAYxUc.png","expandedUrl":"https://x.com/thinkymachines/status/1971623409873244462/photo/1","altText":null,"width":720,"height":378,"durationMs":null}],"photoCount":1,"videoCount":0},"inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToUsername":null,"conversationId":"1971624309262373359","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":18}
{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":41,"creatorName":"Mira Murati","creatorHandle":"miramurati","lane":"Frontier AI / founder","phase1Followers":988543,"authorHandle":"miramurati","authorUserId":"180115578","authorName":"Mira Murati","authorFollowersObserved":992059,"authorFollowingObserved":641,"authorPostsObserved":402,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_originals_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T21:27:09.373Z","id":"1965828555620880442","postType":"quote","text":"A big part of our mission at Thinking Machines is to improve people’s scientific understanding of AI and work with the broader research community. Introducing Connectionism today to share some of our scientific insights.","textSource":"legacy_full_text","textLength":220,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1757525025000,"postedAt":"2025-09-10T17:23:45.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":8596.056770277777,"url":"https://x.com/miramurati/status/1965828555620880442","views":609229,"likes":4639,"reposts":388,"replies":175,"bookmarks":1262,"quotes":53,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":"1965826369721623001","quotedPost":{"id":"1965826369721623001","authorHandle":"thinkymachines","authorName":"Thinking Machines","authorFollowersObserved":182295,"text":"Today Thinking Machines Lab is launching our research blog, Connectionism. Our first blog post is “Defeating Nondeterminism in LLM Inference”\n\nWe believe that science is better when shared. Connectionism will cover topics as varied as our research is: from kernel numerics to prompt engineering. Here we share what we are working on and connect with the research community frequently and openly.\n\nThe name Connectionism is a throwback to an earlier era of AI; it was the name of the subfield in the 1980s that studied neural networks and their similarity to biological brains.\n\nhttps://t.co/lrJioBmpbT","textSource":"note_tweet","postedAt":"2025-09-10T17:15:04.000Z","views":3520915,"likes":7582,"reposts":1241,"replies":230,"bookmarks":5278,"quotes":449,"media":[{"id":"1965825959321538561","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G0gES2uaEAEc01p.jpg","expandedUrl":"https://x.com/thinkymachines/status/1965826369721623001/photo/1","altText":null,"width":1788,"height":939,"durationMs":null}],"photoCount":1,"videoCount":0},"inReplyToStatusId":null,"inReplyToUserId":null,"inReplyToUsername":null,"conversationId":"1965828555620880442","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":19}
